really gross and dirty one thing I found

00:11:06.819 --> 00:11:11.889
though is that it tends to make my scalp
feel quite dry and irritated so I try to

00:11:11.889 --> 00:11:14.740
keep it as far away from my head as
possible they have also recently

00:11:14.740 --> 00:11:19.029
reformulated so hopefully it's a bit
less of a problem the other thing that I

00:11:19.029 --> 00:11:23.170
found works really well is just
cornstarch in a shaker so this is just

00:11:23.170 --> 00:11:29.350
a standard salt shaker I think pepper
shaker full of cornstarch I've been

00:11:29.350 --> 00:11:32.680
using cornstarch on my face as well as a
